flowchart LR
  subgraph Orders[Orders service / owned PostgreSQL]
    tx[State transition transaction]
    seq[(Per-order sequence row)]
    outbox[(Versioned outbox event)]
    tx -->|lock and increment| seq
    tx -->|same commit| outbox
  end
  migration[Additive migration
  deterministic event ID + sequence backfill]
  wal[Logical WAL]
  connect[Debezium Connect
  consistent snapshot then WAL]
  kafka[(Kafka order topic
  key = order ID)]
  subgraph History[Order History service / owned PostgreSQL]
    inbox[(Inbox + payload hash)]
    gap[(Per-order gap buffer)]
    projection[(Versioned projection DB)]
    audit[(Replay audit)]
  end
  consumer[At-least-once consumer]
  dlq[(DLQ topic
  Kafka transaction with offset)]
  cli[Local operator replay / rebuild CLI]
  api[Customer API
  owner from verified token]
  ui[Storefront order history]
  rebuild[New projection target
  high-water catch-up + reconcile]
  migration -. legacy rows .-> outbox
  outbox --> wal --> connect --> kafka --> consumer
  consumer -->|in-order event| inbox
  inbox --> projection
  consumer -->|sequence gap| gap
  gap -. missing predecessor arrives .-> inbox
  consumer -->|invalid/poison| dlq
  dlq --> cli --> consumer
  cli --> audit
  projection --> api --> ui
  rebuild -. replay to cutover marks .-> projection
  rebuild -->|compare retained event IDs/hashes| Orders
